meta {
  name: Desactiver (PUT is_active=false) -- nettoyage final
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admin/api/roles/{{created_role_id}}
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
}

body {
  {
    "label": "Role Demo {{run}} v2",
    "permission_ids": [
      "{{examplePermissionId}}"
    ],
    "visible_sources": [
      "counter",
      "drive"
    ],
    "is_active": false,
    "pin_email": "{{pin_email}}",
    "pin": "{{pin}}"
  }
}

docs {
Aucun endpoint DELETE pour les roles (limite documentee, conventions.md section 5.3 -- un role est rattache a des comptes). Le nettoyage correct est la desactivation, PUT PARTIEL comme pour les utilisateurs.
}
